<title>USA: AmVestors Financial Inc Q4 oper net rises.</title>
<headline>AmVestors Financial Inc Q4 oper net rises.</headline>
<dateline>TOPEKA, Kan. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr prim	    $0.50		    $0.43</p>
<p> Oper shr dil	     $0.39		    $0.43</p>
<p> Oper net		   6,759		    4,484</p>
<p> Revs			57,423		   43,601</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	13,627		   10,388</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	17,450		   10,437</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Oper shr primary	 $1.74		    $1.54</p>
<p> Oper shr diluted	 $1.52		    $1.53</p>
<p> Oper net		  22,297		   15,960</p>
<p> Revs		     211,762		  165,613</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	12,832		   10,354</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	14,697		   10,404</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Excludes Q4 1996 net investment gains and amortizations of $285,000, compared with $1.2 million a year ago, and full year 1996 net investment gain and amortizations of $1.4 million, compared with $689,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>Also excludes net interest expense of $1.2 million in the fourth quarter, compared with $13,000 a year ago, and $2.6 million in full 1996, compared with $50,000 a year ago.</p>
<p>Full 1996 excludes extraordinary loss of $269,000.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
